<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰρύ̆-φρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρήν</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heavy of mind, melancholy,
				gloomy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντυχίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
					140.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰήτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.731
				</span></i>
			; <i>savage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					464
				</span></i>
			; <i>cruel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.174
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>weighty of purpose, grave-minded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.110
			</span></i>.</div>
